Package: dictate-whisper
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Javier Santacruz <javier.santacruz.lc@gmail.com>
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: whisper.cpp
Enhances: dictate
Homepage: https://github.com/jvrsantacruz/dictate
Description: local transcriber for dictate, whisper.cpp with its base model
 A user service that runs whisper.cpp's server on 127.0.0.1:8081, the
 address dictate sends audio to by default, with the multilingual base
 model. Speech is transcribed on this machine.
 .
 The package starts nothing: `dictate setup` enables the service for the
 user who runs it. Needs whisper.cpp, packaged by Ubuntu 26.04 and later.
